 " as a sorted vertex list.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"daf15174-bd3e-4b9e-8983-084fdfc07776"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
