Cell["\<\
The count contract on the cylinder lattice: the support, the list of every \
member, a strict count of two and the empty slice above the top.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"ed128100-ae7b-4d2a-9698-2bdf8cfeae74"],

